    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/198090bbdb8068b68bc394bb06f9a003.poster.avif?t=1753373447\" width=624 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/198090bbdb8068b68bc394bb06f9a003.webm?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/198090bbdb8068b68bc394bb06f9a003.mp4?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veil of Ashes is a real-time tactics game set in a dark steampunk universe. Fight for control of strategic points across diverse maps in both multiplayer and skirmish matches. Command units ranging from infantry and tanks to colossal behemoths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/d937fdeffdf22086f5cd6c57a30ac12c.poster.avif?t=1753373447\" width=624 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/d937fdeffdf22086f5cd6c57a30ac12c.webm?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/d937fdeffdf22086f5cd6c57a30ac12c.mp4?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command various infantry squads, tanks and behemoth units and seize strategic points in tactically demanding battles, whether you're playing solo or facing off against other players. Earn Reinforcement Points during the battle to request the most powerful war machines, tactical strikes and support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/05d5374312df953ac407b3c31b94f82b.poster.avif?t=1753373447\" width=624 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/05d5374312df953ac407b3c31b94f82b.webm?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/05d5374312df953ac407b3c31b94f82b.mp4?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the match, build your own army from different companies with a variety of units . Discover unique play styles and tactical options and adapt to the circumstances of the battle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/a18c9550c99f6eb0d20a96ab9c967191.webp?t=1753373447\" width=625 height=45 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real time tactics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single- and multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skirmish up to 4vs4 (PvE and PvP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large variety of different units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High quality graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and destructable Environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark steampunk setting</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/d6b043d3c80fbd7115a6132a5f5c3ba3.webp?t=1753373447\" width=625 height=45 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The theocratic Sacrum Imperium, led by the Novissima Ecclesia,  is a fanatical faction that overwhelms its enemies with sheer firepower and super-heavy &quot;Cataphractus&quot;-tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cDominating the western Mediterranean and expanding unstoppably, the Sacrum Imperium is the strongest power on the European continent.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The feudal Lohenreich, whose knights march into battle aboard heavily armored &quot;Lanzierer&quot;-tanks, accompanied by loyal &quot;Panzerknecht&quot;-Soldiers.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201dA remnant of ancient times in Central Europe. A mighty empire that is crumbling with each passing day. But its shards are ready to defend what is left.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The socialist Communes that overrun their opponents with agile wheeled armoured vehicles of the \u2018Force Rapide\u2019 and masses of \u2018Volontaires\u2019 and \u2018Conscrits\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe kingdoms of western Europe have fallen under the force of the people\u2019s anger and the Communes are rising in their place. The revolution is far from over.\u201d</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/1a33f91419cebd41d450fcd79a5c0805.webp?t=1753373447\" width=625 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1704, the world was consumed by an unprecedented inferno. Countless states, empires and rulers fell victim to the beginning of the end of the world. But with the fire came Cinium. Energetic fragments of the inferno, as white as angel feathers and incredibly powerful. It was to lay the future for all that was to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 years later, old and new empires have risen from the remnants of the past. They find themselves in a world dominated by industry and ash. More and more land is being turned into lifeless deserts by the storms of embers and fire, while the sky is falling under a grey veil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinium drives the machinery of vital industry, in peace and in war. Powerful steam engines drive tanks and behemoths across the battlefields to defend or conquer the dwindling habitat.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/198090bbdb8068b68bc394bb06f9a003.poster.avif?t=1753373447\" width=624 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/198090bbdb8068b68bc394bb06f9a003.webm?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/198090bbdb8068b68bc394bb06f9a003.mp4?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veil of Ashes is a real-time tactics game set in a dark steampunk universe. Fight for control of strategic points across diverse maps in both multiplayer and skirmish matches. Command units ranging from infantry and tanks to colossal behemoths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/d937fdeffdf22086f5cd6c57a30ac12c.poster.avif?t=1753373447\" width=624 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/d937fdeffdf22086f5cd6c57a30ac12c.webm?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/d937fdeffdf22086f5cd6c57a30ac12c.mp4?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command various infantry squads, tanks and behemoth units and seize strategic points in tactically demanding battles, whether you're playing solo or facing off against other players. Earn Reinforcement Points during the battle to request the most powerful war machines, tactical strikes and support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/05d5374312df953ac407b3c31b94f82b.poster.avif?t=1753373447\" width=624 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/05d5374312df953ac407b3c31b94f82b.webm?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/05d5374312df953ac407b3c31b94f82b.mp4?t=1753373447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the match, build your own army from different companies with a variety of units . Discover unique play styles and tactical options and adapt to the circumstances of the battle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/a18c9550c99f6eb0d20a96ab9c967191.webp?t=1753373447\" width=625 height=45 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real time tactics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single- and multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skirmish up to 4vs4 (PvE and PvP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large variety of different units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High quality graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and destructable Environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark steampunk setting</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/d6b043d3c80fbd7115a6132a5f5c3ba3.webp?t=1753373447\" width=625 height=45 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The theocratic Sacrum Imperium, led by the Novissima Ecclesia,  is a fanatical faction that overwhelms its enemies with sheer firepower and super-heavy &quot;Cataphractus&quot;-tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cDominating the western Mediterranean and expanding unstoppably, the Sacrum Imperium is the strongest power on the European continent.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The feudal Lohenreich, whose knights march into battle aboard heavily armored &quot;Lanzierer&quot;-tanks, accompanied by loyal &quot;Panzerknecht&quot;-Soldiers.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201dA remnant of ancient times in Central Europe. A mighty empire that is crumbling with each passing day. But its shards are ready to defend what is left.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The socialist Communes that overrun their opponents with agile wheeled armoured vehicles of the \u2018Force Rapide\u2019 and masses of \u2018Volontaires\u2019 and \u2018Conscrits\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe kingdoms of western Europe have fallen under the force of the people\u2019s anger and the Communes are rising in their place. The revolution is far from over.\u201d</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511540/extras/1a33f91419cebd41d450fcd79a5c0805.webp?t=1753373447\" width=625 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1704, the world was consumed by an unprecedented inferno. Countless states, empires and rulers fell victim to the beginning of the end of the world. But with the fire came Cinium. Energetic fragments of the inferno, as white as angel feathers and incredibly powerful. It was to lay the future for all that was to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 years later, old and new empires have risen from the remnants of the past. They find themselves in a world dominated by industry and ash. More and more land is being turned into lifeless deserts by the storms of embers and fire, while the sky is falling under a grey veil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinium drives the machinery of vital industry, in peace and in war. Powerful steam engines drive tanks and behemoths across the battlefields to defend or conquer the dwindling habitat.</p>",
